	"data": "Project: Nextcloud Calendar App\n\nVision\nA custom progressive web app (PWA) for Nextcloud calendar management — replacing the built-in Nextcloud calendar UI with a faster, more polished React interface that syncs bidirectionally via CalDAV. Built local-first with offline support.\n\nStatus\nParked. Curriculum scaffolded in January 2026, not yet started. RAG knowledge base already built (calendar_curriculum_resources collection in ChromaDB — 9 records, 4-stage curriculum, ~20 hours estimated).\n\nTech…",
